    "title": "Interview 1965 - The Blueprint for AI Government Revealed with Jacob Nordangård | The Corbett Report",
    "text": "What is the Global Government Technology Centre? Why are they writing whitepapers on The Agentic State? Why are they proposing that governments use AI to create virtual twins of everyone on the planet in order to predict the future? And how does this relate to John Dee, the World Brain, and the centuries-long occultic quest to unite humanity in a world organism? Find out the answers to these and other questions as we talk to Jacob Nordangård of The Pharos Chronicles about his new article, “Welcome to Your Nightmare: The Externalization of the Agentic State.”\nVideo player not working? Use these links to watch it somewhere else!\nWATCH ON: / / / / / or DOWNLOAD THE MP4\nSHOW NOTES:\nJacob Nordangård on The Corbett Report\nThe Pharos Chronicles on Substack\nWelcome to Your Nightmare: The Externalization of the Agentic State\nThe Agentic State: How Agentic AI Will Revamp 10 Functional Layers of Public Administration\nEpisode 473 – Algocracy: Government for the New World Order\nMeet the Sentient World Simulation: How the Government Predicts the Future\nTemple of Solomon by Jacob Nordangård",
